---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="About Me | SolidClip Media"
  description="Meet Andrew Sudyk, founder of SolidClip Media. Learn about the story behind the camera, our approach to filmmaking, and the creativity that drives our work."
>
  <main class="aboutme-page">
    <!-- HERO -->
    <section class="aboutme-hero">
      <div class="aboutme-hero-container">
        <div class="aboutme-hero-content">
          <span class="aboutme-eyebrow">THE PERSON BEHIND THE CAMERA</span>

          <h1>
            Hi, I'm <span>Andrew.</span>
          </h1>

          <p class="aboutme-hero-lead">
            Filmmaker, engineer, and the person behind SolidClip Media.
          </p>

          <p class="aboutme-hero-description">
            What started as a creative outlet has grown into a passion for
            capturing meaningful moments, telling real stories, and creating
            films that people can return to for years.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="aboutme-hero-image">
          <img
            src="/images/andrew.jpg"
            alt="Andrew Sudyk, founder of SolidClip Media"
          />
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- MY STORY -->
    <section class="aboutme-story">
      <div class="aboutme-container">
        <div class="aboutme-section-heading">
          <span class="aboutme-eyebrow">HOW IT STARTED</span>
          <h2>From a Creative Outlet to SolidClip Media.</h2>
        </div>

        <div class="aboutme-story-grid">
          <div class="aboutme-story-image">
            <img
              src="/images/behind-the-scenes.jpg"
              alt="Andrew working behind the scenes on a video production"
              loading="lazy"
            />
          </div>

          <div class="aboutme-story-text">
            <p>
              Before SolidClip Media, there was just Andrew Sudyk Productions.
            </p>

            <p>
              It started with a camera, a passion for creating, and a lot of new
              name ideas and hand drawn logos. In 2021, after countless
              revisions, the logo finally became official. What began as a
              personal creative outlet gradually grew into something much
              bigger.
            </p>

            <p>
              While studying computer engineering, I found that videography
              offered a creative freedom that equations and calculations
              couldn't provide.
            </p>

            <p>
              Whenever a lecture became a little too difficult to sit through,
              I'd find myself opening my editing software and picking up where
              I'd left off on a bridal shower video.
            </p>

            <p>Arranging clips on a timeline felt like painting a picture.</p>

            <p>
              I quickly realized that arranging the right moments in the right
              order, at the right tempo, could evoke genuine emotion.
            </p>

            <p class="aboutme-story-highlight">
              To this day, hearing that someone shed a few happy tears while
              watching their video is one of the greatest compliments I can
              receive.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- FILMING PHILOSOPHY -->
    <section class="aboutme-philosophy">
      <div class="aboutme-philosophy-container">
        <span class="aboutme-eyebrow">OUR APPROACH</span>

        <h2>The Art of Being Unnoticed.</h2>

        <p>
          Since those early days, SolidClip Media has worked with dozens of
          clients, capturing everything from weddings and personal milestones to
          corporate events and promotional productions. There's something
          special about being trusted to document some of the most important
          moments in people's lives. It's a big responsibility, and one we don't
          take lightly.
        </p>

        <p>
          Ironically, a big part of doing our job well is making sure nobody
          notices us doing it. We dress in black, move quietly, and do our best
          to blend into the background.
        </p>

        <!-- FEATURED QUOTE -->
        <blockquote class="aboutme-quote">
          <span class="aboutme-quote-mark">“</span>

          <p class="quote">You guys did so well, we couldn't even see you!</p>

          <p class="signedquote">— A bride, after her wedding day</p>
        </blockquote>

        <p>
          We had spent 12 hours capturing her wedding day, yet somehow managed
          to stay out of the way of the very moments we were there to preserve.
        </p>

        <p>
          That compliment has stuck with me ever since. It's a simple philosophy
          that continues to shape how we approach our work today.
        </p>

        <p class="aboutme-philosophy-statement">
          Capture everything that matters, without becoming part of the moment.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- OUTSIDE THE CAMERA -->
    <section class="aboutme-personal">
      <div class="aboutme-container">
        <div class="aboutme-personal-grid">
          <div class="aboutme-personal-content">
            <span class="aboutme-eyebrow">BEYOND THE CAMERA</span>

            <h2>There's More to the Story.</h2>

            <p>
              When I'm not holding a camera, you'll probably find me riding my
              electric unicycle.
            </p>

            <p>
              And when I'm not doing that, I'm usually working on my latest
              engineering project.
            </p>

            <p>
              Engineering and filmmaking might seem like two completely
              different worlds, but I've come to appreciate how much they have
              in common.
            </p>

            <a
              href="https://andrewsudyk.com"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="aboutme-project-link"
            >
              Explore My Engineering Projects
              <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
            </a>
          </div>

          <div class="aboutme-personal-images">
            <div class="aboutme-personal-image-large">
              <img
                src="/images/unicycle.jpg"
                alt="Andrew riding his electric unicycle"
                loading="lazy"
              />
            </div>

            <div class="aboutme-personal-image-small">
              <img
                src="/images/engineering.jpg"
                alt="Andrew working on an engineering project"
                loading="lazy"
              />
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- CTA -->
    <section class="aboutme-cta">
      <span class="aboutme-eyebrow">YOUR STORY IS NEXT</span>

      <h2>Let's Create Something Meaningful.</h2>

      <p>
        Thanks for taking the time to learn a little about the person behind
        SolidClip Media. I'd love to hear your story, and hopefully get the
        opportunity to tell it through film.
      </p>

      <a href="/#contact-container" class="aboutme-cta-button">
        Get in Touch
        <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
      </a>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>
